==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Bunnelby|97}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion; both cards have the Gnaw attack.
*'''Gnaw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Pikachu|58}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

